128
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:01,600
- Hot stuff?     - It's good to see you, man.

129
00:08:01,810 --> 00:08:04,640
Yeah, you too. Man, so, what are you up to?

130
00:08:05,230 --> 00:08:09,150
