170
00:11:00,740 --> 00:11:05,410
- About 19 pounds.     - It's like me when I was born.

171
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:10,080
All right, who would, uh, like some yams? Will?

172
00:11:10,250 --> 00:11:12,370
Oh, you'd like that, wouldn't you?

173
