Will, but you've worked so hard.

186
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:07,350
- Yams!     - Okay.

187
00:12:10,430 --> 00:12:13,020
Uh, Will, I just wanna say that I'm real sorry fo...

188
00:12:13,230 --> 00:12:15,020
whatever I did to you in high school.

189
00:12:15,270 --> 00:12:17,270
Oh, it wasn't just me. We had a club.

190
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:20,110
