191
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:23,280
The "I Hate Rachel Green Club."

192
00:12:23,490 --> 00:12:26,570
Oh, my God. So, what, you all just joined together to hate me?

193
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:31,660
